description: Keep Prosary web surfaces lean, native, accessible, and cohesive
globs: "{Compose,Repository,Shared/website}/**/*"
alwaysApply: false
---

# Web surfaces

- Preserve the existing framework boundary: React/Vite in `Compose`, Next.js App Router in
  `Repository`, and Astro in `Shared/website`.
- Prefer semantic HTML and browser-native form, dialog, file, storage, history, and media APIs.
- Keep Next.js pages as Server Components unless interaction requires a narrow Client Component;
  pass only the serializable data that client code uses.
- Avoid duplicated page shells, styles, binary state, and assets. Load or decode large media only
  when it is needed, and release object URLs and listeners deterministically.
- Provide responsive layouts, visible focus, clear labels/instructions/status, sufficient contrast,
  reduced-motion behavior, and useful empty/error states on every page.
- Measure bundle or artifact changes where practical and run each web app's build plus its safe
  local tests before committing.
